 "remarks": "Experience exceptional living in beautiful North Stamford, set beside a peaceful bird sanctuary. This impressive 6,480-square-foot residence features a grand two-story foyer, spacious interiors, and outstanding amenities designed for comfortable living and entertaining.   First Floor: Bright and inviting living spaces include a living room, family room, formal dining room, breakfast nook, gourmet kitchen, powder room, and laundry room. The chef's kitchen features granite countertops, a center island, Sub-Zero refrigeration, a gas range, multiple dishwashers, and propane cooking.  Second Floor: The upper level offers five spacious bedrooms and five bathrooms, including a luxurious primary suite with a spa-style bathroom, soaking tub, and separate shower. Four generously sized bedrooms come furnished, offering added convenience for tenants.   Finished Lower Level: Enjoy an impressive recreation and fitness area equipped with gym equipment, weights, exercise machines, and a treadmill. Additional entertainment features include a TV, billiard table, and ping-pong table. A wine cellar adds another distinctive touch to this exceptional home.   Outdoor Living: Relax or entertain on the large outdoor patio, complete with an outdoor grill and a dining table and chairs, perfect for gatherings and enjoying the peaceful surroundings.   This remarkable property combines generous living space, premium amenities, and a serene natural setting, offering a wonderful rental opportu",
